---
title: Bootstrap Window — End-to-End Sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor OpA as Operator A
    actor OpB as Operator B
    participant Seal as Seal Authority
    participant Gate as Power Gate
    participant AI as GPU Platform
    participant Orch as llm_orchestrator
    participant MCP as mcp_edge
    participant Store as capsule_store
    participant Voice as voice_tag
    actor Cur as Curator (SME)

    Note over OpA,Cur: System is SEALED. Voice tags and novel events have been queueing.

    OpA->>Seal: request_mode_transition(BOOTSTRAP, reason="quarterly recal")
    OpB->>Seal: co-sign authorization
    Seal->>Seal: verify two-key, cooldown, integrity
    Seal-->>OpA: TransitionReceipt(success=true)
    Seal->>Gate: enable GPU Platform power rail
    Gate->>AI: power on (boot ~30s)
    AI-->>Gate: ready

    Seal-->>Orch: mode change event (SEALED → BOOTSTRAP)
    Orch->>Store: get_disconnection_summary()
    Store-->>Orch: 47 pending voice tags, 12 novel events

    Note over Orch: Catch-up phase

    loop For each pending voice tag
        Orch->>Store: get_voice_tag(tag_id)
        Orch->>AI: propose canonical label
        AI-->>Orch: candidate + confidence
        alt confidence > 0.9
            Orch->>MCP: propose_canonical_label(...)
            MCP->>Store: write proposal
        else
            Orch->>MCP: request_human_review(...)
        end
    end

    loop For each novel event
        Orch->>AI: cluster against known ontology
        AI-->>Orch: ontology proposal or "no good fit"
        Orch->>MCP: propose_ontology_update(...)
    end

    Note over Cur: Curator reviews proposals

    Cur->>MCP: activate_proposal(...) or reject
    MCP->>Store: write canonical labels / ontology entries

    Note over OpA,Cur: Recalibration complete

    OpA->>Seal: request_mode_transition(SEALED, reason="recal complete")
    OpB->>Seal: co-sign
    Seal->>Seal: validate, cooldown, integrity
    Seal->>Gate: disable GPU Platform power rail
    Gate->>AI: power off
    Seal-->>Orch: mode change event (BOOTSTRAP → SEALED)
    Orch->>Orch: shut down all gated operations

    Note over OpA,Cur: System is SEALED again. Bootstrap window report archived.
